player_prompt.intro:
Inu ni Jatelo {player_id} e kare Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma a jatelo 3. Mipira ina dhi {num_rounds} kare.
Kare ni kama ifuatavyo:
• {conv_rounds} muda wa lokwalo
• 1 muda wa kelo - yiero mbele moja kwa kila jatelo: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' kana '[<opp-id> defect]' (yaani '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; kibali cha msingi ni 'cooperate'). 
Matriki ya mapato ya jo-uro (inatumika kwa kila jo uro):
  - Wote wawili wakati  ->  {reward}
  - Wote wawili wakosa     ->  {punishment}
  - Inu ukose, wao wakati -> {temptation}
  - Inu ukati, wao wakose -> {sucker}
Jatelo ase adhi mbele zaidi e mwisho wa kare wote ndiye atakayeshinda.
